<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Burmah lowered at BZW.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Burmah lowered at BZW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burmah Castrol was cut to &quot;hold&quot; from a &quot;buy&quot; at BZW, market sources said on Monday, after a 12 percent gain in the stock since July 23.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>In a generally firm market, the stock was up 1/2p at 10.97-1/2 stg by 1159 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
